      "statistic": "Extracted from a linear fit in the exponential-growth phase of the decorrelator; errorbars from fit errors.",
      "uncertainty": "No pointwise uncertainty for the derived ratio is reported; the exponent uncertainty is alpha=0.59±0.04 with convention source_unspecified.",
      "resolution": null,
      "anchors": [
        {
          "line_start": 289,
          "line_end": 292,
          "support": "These difference fields allow us to construct the spatially averaged decorrelator Phi which we plot... We see a convincing exponential regime from which we can extract the Lyapunov exponent lambda_DNS."
        },
