          "line_start": 372,
          "line_end": 376,
          "support": "For measurements from the DNSs... we estimate the Lyapunov exponents from a linear fit in the exponential-growth phase of the decorrelators; the errors on such fits yield the errorbars on lambda_DNS."
        }
